1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:02,799
Cent #2616.

2
00:00:02,839 --> 00:00:06,320
A penny struck in 1912, at Philadelphia.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,199
The only Cent from 1912 in the collection.

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,199
One of 12 1/1 Years,

5
